    'goal.sugar': 'Sugar', 'goal.sugar.t': 'Your taste buds can start over too.',
    'goal.anxiety': 'Anxiety', 'goal.anxiety.t': 'Breathe. This moment will pass.',
    'goal.sleep': 'Sleep', 'goal.sleep.t': 'Rest is a fresh start too.',
    'goal.start': 'Start', 'goal.notify': 'Notify me',
    'goals.more': 'Another habit you want to break? See the full catalog',
    'stats.title': 'Alento in real numbers.',
    'stats.n1': '5', 'stats.l1': 'well-being programs, one for each fresh start',
    'stats.n2': '30', 'stats.l2': 'lessons per journey, in short doable steps',
    'stats.n3': '1 min', 'stats.l3': 'of guided breathing, available anytime',
    'press.label': 'What you will always find in Alento', 'press.slot': 'Outlet',
    'press.f1': 'Transparency about privacy', 'press.f2': 'Cancel anytime',
    'press.f3': 'Your data is yours', 'press.f4': 'Human support',
    'man.eyebrow': 'Manifesto', 'man.l1': 'Every fresh start', 'man.l2': 'begins with', 'man.l3': 'a breath.',
    'man.text': 'Nobody quits a habit all at once. You quit for a day, then another. Some days feel heavy, some days you slip, and that’s okay. Alento is here for those days: to support you when it’s hard, celebrate when it goes well and remind you that you can always start again.',
    'how.eyebrow': 'The Alento method', 'how.title': 'Change that fits your routine.',
    'how.sub': 'Behavioral science, breathing and support in small steps that add up every day.',
    's1.t': 'Understand your habit', 's1.p': 'A few quick questions show when, where and why the habit shows up. No judgment.',
    's2.t': 'A plan at your pace', 's2.p': 'A path made for you, with a turning-point day you choose together. Adjust it whenever you like.',
    's3.t': 'Breathe through the urge', 's3.p': 'Cravings come in waves. One-minute guided breathing helps you ride each one out.',
    's4.t': 'Small wins, every day', 's4.p': 'Every day counts and shows up in your progress: days, money saved, milestones.',
    's5.t': 'Start again, guilt-free', 's5.p': 'Slips are part of the journey. Alento doesn’t erase your story: it helps you get back on track.',
    'how.note': 'Alento is a tool to support habit change and does not replace medical or psychological care.',
    'pocket.eyebrow': 'Always with you', 'pocket.title': 'Support right when the urge hits.',
    'f1.t': 'Personalized plan', 'f1.p': 'Built from your answers, on your schedule.',
    'f2.t': 'Guided breathing', 'f2.p': 'One-minute exercises for the hard moments.',
    'f3.t': 'Visible progress', 'f3.p': 'Days, savings and milestones, all in one place.',
    'f4.t': 'Daily encouragement', 'f4.p': 'One message a day to remind you why you started.',
    'f5.t': 'Gentle reminders', 'f5.p': 'Nudges at the right time, never pressure.',
    'f6.t': 'Support', 'f6.p': 'If something doesn’t work, write to us from the app: a human team will answer.',
    'store.web.s': 'Available now in your browser', 'store.web.b': 'Open the web app',
    'who.eyebrow': 'Who it’s for', 'who.title': 'Made for people who have tried before and want a lighter way.',
    'who.q1': '“I’ve tried to quit many times and always pushed myself too hard.”',
    'who.q2': '“I want more breath to enjoy life.”',
    'who.q3': '“I don’t want a habit deciding my day for me.”',
    'alt.man': 'Man smiling with his eyes closed on a balcony in the morning, with the city behind him',
    'alt.who1': 'Woman smiling while looking at her phone, sitting at home', 'alt.who2': 'Man smiling as he walks through a park', 'alt.who3': 'Woman with her eyes closed in the sun, breathing calmly',
    'stories.eyebrow': 'The journey', 'stories.title': 'Every day counts. Here’s what awaits you.',
    'stories.note': 'Cards about how Alento works in practice. They are not promises of results or clinical accounts.',
    'aria.prev': 'Previous', 'aria.next': 'Next',
    'faq.eyebrow': 'Questions', 'faq.title': 'Frequently asked questions', 'faq.sub': 'Didn’t find what you were looking for? <a href="/ayuda">Get in touch</a>.',
    'q1': 'What is Alento?', 'a1': 'Alento builds apps that help people break habits that harm them. Each program combines a plan at your own pace, guided breathing, progress tracking and plenty of support.',
    'q2': 'Who is Alento for?', 'a2': 'For adults who want to change their relationship with a habit, whether it’s their first try or they’ve tried many times. No prior experience needed.',
    'q3': 'How do I know which path is right for me?', 'a3': 'Right at the start you answer a few quick questions. Based on them, Alento builds a plan that respects where you are and your pace.',
    'q4': 'Do I have to quit all at once?', 'a4': 'No. You decide with the app how and when to make the change. For many people, cutting down gradually works better, and that’s fine.',
    'q5': 'What if I slip up?', 'a5': 'Slips are part of the journey. Alento won’t erase your progress or blame you: it helps you understand what happened and start again.',
    'q6': 'How much time does it take each day?', 'a6': 'Just a few minutes. Most activities take 1 to 5 minutes, and you can use it whenever and wherever you like.',
    'q7': 'Does Alento replace medical or psychological treatment?', 'a7': 'No. Alento is a support tool for changing habits. If you’re in treatment or taking medication, talk to your health professional before changing your routine. In a crisis, seek professional help or contact your local emergency services.',
    'q8': 'How much does it cost?', 'a8': 'Alento works on a subscription with weekly, monthly and quarterly plans. Each program’s price and billing period are always shown before you pay. You only pay for the programs you choose, and cancellation details stay visible at all times.',
    'q9': 'Can I cancel anytime?', 'a9': 'Yes. Open «My subscription», tap «Manage subscription and invoices» and cancel in a couple of steps: you keep access until the end of the paid period, with no fees and no calls.',
    'q10': 'Is my data safe?', 'a10': 'Your information is stored with authentication and per-user access controls: nobody but you can see your records. From the app itself you can download a copy of your data or delete your account whenever you want. Alento does not sell your data.',
    'q11': 'Which devices does it work on?', 'a11': 'Alento works in the browser of your phone or computer, and you can install it as an app: on iPhone/iPad with «Add to Home Screen», and on Android with the install option Chrome suggests. A native store version is in preparation.',
    'final.title': 'Your next chapter starts now.', 'final.sub': 'Answer a few questions and get a plan made for you.',
